@title Wiring: a Wire-it export that cannot be written is a triangle on the job, with Try again
@area Reports
# T5: no red toast. The failed job is a red triangle in the top bar beside the Issues pill; its popover names the file and offers Try again and Dismiss. The same export to a good place clears it.
open qa/fixtures/connection-points.novo
wait 30
# A first export makes a plain file; a folder below a file cannot be created, so the second one fails.
answer_dialog ~/blocker.pdf
key ctrl+k
text "Export the Wire-it list"
key Enter
wait 30
answer_dialog ~/blocker.pdf/wire-it-list.pdf
key ctrl+k
text "Export the Wire-it list"
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Error: Wire-it list not exported"
shot job-flag-top-bar
check_layout
click_text "Error: Wire-it list not exported" Button
wait 6
expect "Try again"
expect "Dismiss"
shot job-flag-popover
check_layout
key Escape
wait 4
answer_dialog ~/wire-it-list.pdf
key ctrl+k
text "Export the Wire-it list"
key Enter
wait 30
expect_not "Error: Wire-it list not exported"
shot job-flag-gone
check_layout
